## Troubleshooting Checklist

| Issue | Check |
|-------|-------|
| Calls not arriving | Verify Origination URI in Vobiz points to your LiveKit FQDN on port 5060 |
| "Trunk not found" / 404 | Ensure **Allowed Addresses** in LiveKit includes Vobiz's signaling IPs |
| 401 / 407 Unauthorized on outbound | Re-copy Username/Password from the Vobiz portal — match exact case and characters |
| 403 Forbidden | If using IP ACL, verify your LiveKit server's public IP is in Vobiz's IP ACL list |
| Outbound goes to wrong host | Use the exact `<trunkId>.sip.vobiz.ai` from your trunk page — not a generic Vobiz hostname |
| One-way audio | Confirm UDP/RTP ports are open in your cloud firewall and `use_external_ip: true` is set in `livekit-sip` config if behind NAT |
| No room created | Check dispatch rule is linked to the correct trunk ID |
| Failover not working | Verify multiple Origination URIs configured with different priorities (Step 5) |
| Caller ID wrong on outbound | Check the **Numbers** field on your LiveKit Outbound Trunk matches your Vobiz DID |

