## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Vobiz Side:**
```
Trunk: LiveKit Trunk
Outbound Host: <trunkId>.sip.vobiz.ai (per-trunk, auto-issued)

Authentication:
  → Digest: livekit_user / [password]   (optional)
  → IP ACL: Your LiveKit Server Public IP   (optional)
  → Use either or both

Origination URIs (Inbound):
  → URI: sip:your-livekit-server.com:5060
  → Priority: 10, Weight: 10

Region:
  → Single global (no regional endpoints)

Numbers:
  → Attached via Phone Numbers → trunk/application
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Vobiz Inbound
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Vobiz DID
  → Allowed Addresses: Vobiz signaling IPs
  → Auth: digest creds or empty (matches Vobiz auth mode)

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Vobiz Inbound trunk
  → Type: Direct/Individual/Multi-Line (your choice)
  → Agent: Your AI agent

Outbound Trunk:
  → Name: Vobiz Outbound
  → Address: <trunkId>.sip.vobiz.ai
  → Transport: UDP
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Auth: digest creds or empty (matches Vobiz auth mode)
  → Numbers: Your Vobiz DID
```

